Okay, imagine your school has a big assembly where all the teachers and class monitors get together to make the most important rules for the whole school.

In China, the **National People's Congress** is like that big assembly, but for the whole country. They are a very big group of people chosen from all over China to meet and decide the most important things for the country, like making new laws and choosing the main leaders.

Think of it as the biggest, most important meeting in China where they decide how to make the country a better, safer, and happier place for everyone who lives there. [end of text]


